{
    "title": "Maze for Kids",
    "description": "A cute maze game suitable for all ages!\r\n\r\nThe are <b>multiple maze sizes</b> to choose from, so even the youngest children can play the game. As they <b>improve their skills</b>, they can try more difficult mazes.  \r\nDo you think this game is only for kids? Give it a try even if you are an adult! You'll be amazed how relaxing the gamplay is.\r\n\r\nAll mazes are <b>procedurally generated</b>, so you won't solve the same maze twice!\r\n\r\nYou can choose from nine <b>characters</b> to play with:  \r\n\u2022 <b>Gizmo the mouse</b> is hungry and smells some cheese!  \r\n\u2022 <b>Pepper the cat</b> is looking for her toy!  \r\n\u2022 <b>Bonnie the dog</b> wants to play fetch!  \r\n\u2022 <b>Hank the bee</b> is on his way to a flower!  \r\n\u2022 <b>Toby the monkey</b> always ready for a banana!  \r\n\u2022 <b>Pumpkin the bunny</b> loves carrots!  \r\n\u2022 <b>Trixie the dinosaur</b> lost her egg!  \r\n\u2022 <b>Jimmy the worm</b> is searching for an apple!  \r\n\u2022 <b>Rudolph the reindeer</b> is looking for his favourite candy!  \r\n\r\nThere are nine totally different <b>maze themes</b>, so you never get bored.\r\n\r\nYou can try all sizes, characters and themes, but a one time in-app purchase is required to unlock them all.\r\n\r\nThis game <b>does not contain any ads</b> and does not collect any personal information about you.\r\n\r\nIf you or your child likes the game, please leave a review.  \r\nIf you don't like it or if you found a bug, please let us know, so we can improve the game.\r\n\r\nHave fun!",
    "descriptionHTML": "A cute maze game suitable for all ages!<br><br>The are <b>multiple maze sizes</b> to choose from, so even the youngest children can play the game. As they <b>improve their skills</b>, they can try more difficult mazes.  <br>Do you think this game is only for kids? Give it a try even if you are an adult! You&#39;ll be amazed how relaxing the gamplay is.<br><br>All mazes are <b>procedurally generated</b>, so you won&#39;t solve the same maze twice!<br><br>You can choose from nine <b>characters</b> to play with:  <br>\u2022 <b>Gizmo the mouse</b> is hungry and smells some cheese!  <br>\u2022 <b>Pepper the cat</b> is looking for her toy!  <br>\u2022 <b>Bonnie the dog</b> wants to play fetch!  <br>\u2022 <b>Hank the bee</b> is on his way to a flower!  <br>\u2022 <b>Toby the monkey</b> always ready for a banana!  <br>\u2022 <b>Pumpkin the bunny</b> loves carrots!  <br>\u2022 <b>Trixie the dinosaur</b> lost her egg!  <br>\u2022 <b>Jimmy the worm</b> is searching for an apple!  <br>\u2022 <b>Rudolph the reindeer</b> is looking for his favourite candy!  <br><br>There are nine totally different <b>maze themes</b>, so you never get bored.<br><br>You can try all sizes, characters and themes, but a one time in-app purchase is required to unlock them all.<br><br>This game <b>does not contain any ads</b> and does not collect any personal information about you.<br><br>If you or your child likes the game, please leave a review.  <br>If you don&#39;t like it or if you found a bug, please let us know, so we can improve the game.<br><br>Have fun!",
